  "description": "SUSPAZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H54 Er4 N30 O12,2(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 4 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 4 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.812-4.171 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.40-121.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H54Er4N30O12·2(C3H7NO). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
